# INVENTORY RESERVATION CACHE

Reservation must be stored in Redis.

Flow:

Reserve Stock
↓
Store Reservation in Redis
↓
Payment Success
↓
Commit Reservation
↓
Remove Reservation

If payment expires:

Release Reservation

Automatically cleanup expired reservations.

